    "question": {
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/hard",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the matrix\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 8 & 0 & 8 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & -2\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "- $B$ is upper triangular: **true**. All entries below the main diagonal are zero.\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 8 & 0 & 8 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- $B$ is lower triangular: **false**. The entry in row 1, column 2 is $8\\ne 0$, above the main diagonal.\n\n$$\nB=\\begin{bmatrix}6 & 8 & 0 & 8 \\\\ 0 & 2 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\n- $B-{B}^{T}$ is upper triangular: **false**. The entry in row 2, column 1 is $-8\\ne 0$, below the main diagonal.\n\n$$\nB-{B}^{T}=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 8 & 0 & 8 \\\\ -8 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -8 & 0 & 0 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\n$$",
      ":question/id": "c0c1c06c-c4d0-55f8-b835-1859c84622e8",
